<title>NEW ZEALAND: ADVISORY - Peters news conference on RB Act, 1 p.m.</title>
<headline>ADVISORY - Peters news conference on RB Act, 1 p.m.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand First leader Winston Peters on Tuesday scheduled a news conference on the Reserve Bank Act for 1 p.m.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
